Fix server-mode blank 3MF preview (typed arrays mangled over WebSocket) (#72)
Fix Docker grid scroll crashes/floods when hydrating thumb-less 3MF models
Suppress Chromium dbus connection error spam in Docker logs
Preparing for 2.2 Public

